xarray-um

The Rust UM header parsing and WGDOS decoding derive from the NIWA
um2netcdf implementation by Mark Cheeseman (2014), distributed under
GPL-3.0-or-later: https://github.com/adeytown/um2netcdf

The included NZRA STASH-to-CF XML retains its original author and modification
comments, including contributions from NIWA staff. This package's name does
not imply endorsement by the original authors or the UK Met Office.

The backend has been developed against NZRA sample files. Supported scientific
operations and limitations are described in README.md; compatibility with all
Unified Model files is not asserted.
